---
title: Document tools — architecture and trust boundaries
---
flowchart LR
    %% Author: YottaDynamics | Scope: current document ingestion/generation implementation
    %% Purpose: Explain the Python helper, sandbox, and pure-Go boundaries added for document tools.

    User([User / model tool call])

    subgraph AgentBoundary[internal/agent — tool boundary]
        ReadDoc[ReadDocumentTool<br/>read_document]
        CreateDoc[CreateDocumentTool<br/>create_document]
        ValidateRead[ValidateReadPath<br/>credential deny-list]
        ValidateWrite[ValidateWritePath<br/>workspace / allow-path policy]
        Sandbox[Sandbox interface<br/>HostSandbox or PodmanSandbox]
        HelperResolve[resolvePyHelperScript<br/>podman path or host cache]
    end

    subgraph DocumentsCore[internal/documents — content library]
        Registry[Registry<br/>format dispatch]
        Native[Native extract/generate<br/>csv · json · html · xlsx · pptx · docx fallback]
        PDF[PDFExtractor<br/>pdftotext/pdfinfo]
        DocAST[DocAST renderer<br/>Markdown for pandoc]
        PySeams[CommandRunner + ScriptResolver<br/>interfaces only]
    end

    subgraph PythonHelpers[Python helper drivers]
        FillDocx[fill_docx_template.py<br/>python-docx]
        ExtractTables[extract_pdf_tables.py<br/>pdfplumber]
    end

    subgraph Execution[Execution environment]
        Host[Host PATH<br/>direct subprocess]
        Podman[Podman session container<br/>configured image]
        DefaultUBI[Default UBI sandbox image<br/>general-purpose, document deps may be missing]
        DocsImage[yottacode-documents image<br/>pandoc · weasyprint · poppler · python libs]
    end

    subgraph Storage[Local files]
        SourceDocs[Input documents/images/templates]
        OutputDocs[Generated output files]
        Cache[~/.yottacode/cache/doc-helpers<br/>host materialized scripts, 0644]
    end

    User -->|read file| ReadDoc
    User -->|generate file, approval required| CreateDoc

    ReadDoc -->|input path| ValidateRead --> SourceDocs
    CreateDoc -->|output path| ValidateWrite --> OutputDocs
    CreateDoc -->|image/template read paths| ValidateRead

    ReadDoc --> Registry --> Native
    ReadDoc --> Registry --> PDF
    CreateDoc -->|xlsx/pptx native| Native
    CreateDoc -->|docx/pdf blocks| DocAST

    PDF -->|subprocess command| PySeams
    DocAST -->|pandoc command| Sandbox
    CreateDoc -->|template mode| HelperResolve --> FillDocx
    PDF -->|optional table tier| HelperResolve --> ExtractTables

    HelperResolve -->|host sandbox| Cache
    HelperResolve -->|podman sandbox| DocsImage

    PySeams --> Sandbox
    Sandbox -->|nil / host| Host
    Sandbox -->|podman| Podman
    Podman --> DefaultUBI
    Podman --> DocsImage

    FillDocx -->|runs through Sandbox| Host
    FillDocx -->|runs through Sandbox| Podman
    ExtractTables -->|runs through Sandbox| Host
    ExtractTables -->|runs through Sandbox| Podman

    classDef trust fill:#16231d,stroke:#6bf0ad,color:#e8fff2;
    classDef seam fill:#20211a,stroke:#f5d76e,color:#fff7cf;
    classDef risk fill:#2a1717,stroke:#ff7a7a,color:#ffe8e8;
    classDef ext fill:#18202b,stroke:#8ab4ff,color:#edf4ff;
    class AgentBoundary,DocumentsCore trust;
    class PySeams,HelperResolve seam;
    class DefaultUBI risk;
    class Host,Podman,DocsImage,PythonHelpers,Storage ext;
